From c82ce38cab3fe9fa3e886dfd2808692e26144990 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:59:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: restyle the remaining surfaces through shared pieces

Audit of every Gallery surface; what they share, solved once:
- Sheets (PlaitSheet, the design guide's sheet for views): Details (label
  over value, EXIF as a section), Add to album (album rows with a tonal
  tile, folder underneath, New album first) and Settings (a switch row)
- Shared header (filtershow_actionbar, now with a title id): the editor,
  Crop ("Crop" / "Done"; its close and save buttons now work) and Trim
  ("Trim video" / "Save" instead of an all-caps SAVE)
- Legacy theme: every Holo style moved to DeviceDefault (Material You):
  the photo picker, video player, trim and crop get the system's tinted
  controls, dialogs and menus; action bars without the app logo, sentence
  case menu text
- Video player: back arrow and title only, Share opens the system share
  sheet (not the inline recent-targets list), up goes to the Plait library
- Copy: sentence case and buttons that say what happens (Save your
  changes? Discard / Save copy; Export image; Image info; Show applied
  effects; Black & white; Auto color); Straighten shows its name; the
  state panel and info panel are no longer all caps
- Frames are named (Film, Brush, Grunge, Ink, Tape, Black, White, Cream,
  rounded variants); every one said "None"
- Colour swatches (Markup, frame colour): 36 dp circles, accent ring on
  the chosen one, no dark toolbar box
- versionCode 40063

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
